msgctxt "#31388"
msgid ""
"This skin is designed to simulate Netflix user experience for TV.[CR]In order to get everything running as it should, it's recommended to set the following Kodi options:[CR][CR][COLOR ff41b957]    - Disable mouse[CR]    - Hide parent folder items[CR]    - Auto focus first unwatched episode[CR]    - Flatten TV Shows seasons (show all episodes)[CR]    - Set media default action to 'Resume'[/COLOR][CR][CR]Note that this settings are global and will be valid for all installed skins.[CR]But no worries, all settings can be "
"reverted in Kodi settings."
msgstr "这款皮肤旨在模拟在电视上使用 Netflix 时的用户体验。[CR]为确保所有功能都能正常运行，建议设置以下 Kodi 参数：[CR][CR][COLOR ff41b957]    - 禁用鼠标操作[CR]    - 隐藏父文件夹中的项目[CR]    - 自动将未观看的剧集设置为当前播放内容[CR]    - 将电视节目的季集显示方式设置为“显示所有剧集”[CR]    - 将媒体的默认操作设置为“继续播放”[/COLOR][CR][CR]需要注意的是，这些设置是全局性的，因此会对所有已安装的皮肤产生影响。[CR]不过不用担心，所有这些设置都可以在 Kodi 的设置界面中重新进行调整。"

msgctxt "#31389"
msgid "OK, do it for me!"
msgstr "好的，立即设置！"

msgctxt "#31390"
msgid "I want to keep my current config"
msgstr "保持当前配置"

msgctxt "#31391"
msgid "Change action"
msgstr "改变操作"

msgctxt "#31392"
msgid "Disable shortcut"
msgstr "禁用快捷方式"

